:legend
Sketch: sketch animate
XKCD: xkcd animate
Chalk: chalk animate
Shadow: shadow animate
Glow: glow animate
Neon: neon animate
[Perimeter Spark]: spark animate  particle-count=5 particle-random=3
[Perimeter Ping]: ping animate animation-speed=slow
[Perimeter Packet]: packet animate particle-count=4

[Dashed] -> [Dash flow]: bold dashed animate
[Dotted] -> [Dot flow]: dotted animate
[Spark] -> [One particle]: spark animate
[Ping] -> [Expanding ring]: ping animate
[Both] -> [Flow + spark]: dashed spark animate
[Reverse] -> [Random]: spark animate-reverse animation-speed=2 particle-count=3 particle-random=2
[Chevron] -> *: chevron animate particle-density=4 particle-scale=0.6
[Packet] -> [Moving payload]: packet animate particle-density=2 particle-scale=1.3
[Chevron] -> [Block]: block chevron
[Moving chevrons] -> [Backwards]: block chevron animate-reverse
[Bidir chevron] <-> *: block chevron animate particle-balance=75
[Bidir spark] <-> *: spark animate particle-density=2 particle-random=4
